Attack with your bow or dual-weapons for [122%, 131%, 138%, 144%, 150% (TL1-5)] damage.  If you shoot an arrow you'll teleport near the target location.  If you use your dual-weapons you'll teleport up to your bow's range away.

Additionally you now go Out of Phase for five turns after any teleport, gaining [10, 13, 15, 17, 18 (TL1-5; MAG 100)] defense and [6%, 8%, 9%, 10%, 11% (TL1-5; MAG 100)] resist all.

The Out of Phase bonuses will scale with your Magic stat.
